{
  "title": { "zh": "大仓库" },
  "after": {
    "zh": "目录一旦进了历史，之后每一轮都要再读一遍。没有元件回应它的要目录，模型就换一条路：跑测试，从失败报告里找到文件。给模型的工具少一个，有时反而更省。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "2-C",
      "kind": "board",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "三十多个包的仓库，光目录就很长。修好这个 issue，总共不超过 2000 个 token。"
      },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "模型的每次调用都要读一遍整个上下文。" }],
      "tests": [{ "issue": "webhook-retry" }],
      "budget": { "tokens": 2000 },
      "solution": [
        "k = concat(issue, history)",
        "m = model(k)",
        "r = read(m)",
        "t = test(m)",
        "keep = concat(r, t.out)",
        "repo <- m",
        "out <- keep",
        "stop <- t.green"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "k = concat(issue, history)",
        "m = model(k)",
        "r = read(m)",
        "l = list(m)",
        "t = test(m)",
        "keep = concat(r, l, t.out)",
        "repo <- m",
        "out <- keep",
        "stop <- t.green"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
